WEBVTT

00:07:59.476 --> 00:08:00.676
for these children.

00:08:01.076 --> 00:08:03.276
I’m saying that their parents
have good reasons

00:08:03.276 --> 00:08:04.876
for supposing that it might be.

00:08:05.956 --> 00:08:08.916
And I’m also not saying
that sharing their values

00:08:08.956 --> 00:08:12.556
and listening to their children
and their interest in technology

00:08:12.596 --> 00:08:14.756
is going to solve
all of family’s problems --

00:08:14.796 --> 00:08:15.916
of course it won’t.

00:08:16.756 --> 00:08:18.956
But I think it can help,

00:08:18.996 --> 00:08:22.796
because it means that families don’t have
to fight against the inevitable,

00:08:22.796 --> 00:08:24.636
because the digital is not going away.

00:08:26.036 --> 00:08:28.636
And it means that parents
don’t have to try

00:08:28.636 --> 00:08:31.316
to do the same as everybody else,